#: config.cpp:29
msgid "Decoration Settings"
msgstr "versiering instellings"

#: config.cpp:31
msgid "Frame &Width"
msgstr "raam wydte"

#: config.cpp:34
msgid ""
"By moving this slider back and forth, you can adjust the width of the window "
"frame to a value of your liking.\n"
"Note: If you move the slider to it's leftmost position, the window frames "
"will be turned off, which means that you won't be able to resize windows by "
"clicking and dragging their borders."
msgstr ""

#: config.cpp:41
msgid "Thin"
msgstr "dun"

#: config.cpp:42
msgid "Medium"
msgstr "medium"

#: config.cpp:44
msgid "Wide"
msgstr "wye"

#: config.cpp:47
msgid "Text &Alignment"
msgstr "teks oplyn"

#: config.cpp:49
msgid "Use these buttons to set the alignment of the titlebar caption text."
msgstr "gebruik hierdie knoppies aan stel die oplyn van die titelbar kas-tipe teks."

#: config.cpp:51
msgid "Centered"
msgstr "gesentreer"

#: config.cpp:55
msgid "Draw window frames using &titlebar colors"
msgstr "teken venster rame te gebruik titelbar kleure"

#: config.cpp:56
msgid ""
"When selected, the window decoration borders are drawn using the titlebar "
"colors. Otherwise, they are drawn using normal border colors instead."
msgstr ""
"wanneer gekose, die venster versiering grense word geteken te gebruik die titelbar "
"kleure. andersins, hulle word geteken te gebruik normale grens kleure in plaas van."

#: config.cpp:60
msgid "Titlebar acts like a &pushbutton when clicked"
msgstr "titelbar tree op hou van 'n drukknoppie wanneer gekliek het"

#: config.cpp:61
msgid ""
"When selected, this option causes the window titlebar to behave as if it was "
"a pushbutton when you click it to move the window."
msgstr ""
"wanneer gekose, hierdie opsie veroorsaak die venster titelbar aan gedra as as dit was "
"'n drukknoppie wanneer jy kliek dit aan beweeg die venster."

#: config.cpp:64
msgid ""
"Tip: If you just want the look of the original Motif(tm) Window Manager,\n"
"click the \"Buttons\" tab on the left, and then remove the help\n"
"and close buttons from the titlebar."
msgstr ""
"leidraad: as jy net wil hê die kyk van die oorspronklike motif(tm) venster bestuurder,\n"
"kliek die \"knoppies\" oortjie op die links, en dan word verwyder die hulp\n"
"en maak toe knoppies van die titelbar."